
[l_english.DECISION_C12_HELP_BUILD_CIVIL_INDUSTRY]
Help Appleloosa Build civil industry

[l_english.DECISION_C12_HELP_BUILD_CIVIL_INDUSTRY_desc]
Donate factories in Appleloosa under the Pie Family’s name to increase the local ponies’ familiarity with us and improve their favor toward our cause.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_HELP_BUILD_CIVIL_INDUSTRY]
帮助苹果鲁萨发展工业

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_HELP_BUILD_CIVIL_INDUSTRY_desc]
以派家族的名字给苹果鲁萨的小马捐赠工厂，提高当地小马对我们的了解和好感
